            text = "chunk_069: ᏙᏅ ᏬᎷᏨ about two weeks Ᏼ ᏕᏥᏕᎸ Ꮎ ᏗᏍᏚᎢᏍᏓ “here is the keys. This key here fits that and this one over there and that over there and cash register is right there and here is the key to the cash register. I don’t know what they are going to do about that money. I don’t know who's money it is” ᏭᎷᏨ Ꮓ Ꮕ ᎤᎾᎵᎪᏩᏕᎩ Ꮎ Ross Ꮓ ᎣᏍᏓ ᏄᏅᏁᎵᏙᎸ ᎤᎾ Ꮓ job ᏅᎩᎲᏂ ᏄᎵᏍᏓᏅ about two or three weeks ᎢᎧ Ꮲ Ꮭ job ᏯᎩᎮ?"
